{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 31, :comments ["<b>Nebuchadnezzar the king</b> — Now he begins to recount the letter that Nebuchadnezzar wrote to all the peoples dwelling in all the land of his kingdom, and at the beginning of the letter: שלמכון ישגא — may it increase, like: הן אל שגיא (Job 36:26)."], :book :daniel, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Daniel - Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/daniel"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:19:42.689591132Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}